  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "社會事業與永續經營管理數位學習(三)",
    "sub_ename": "SOCIAL ENTERPRISE AND SUSTAINABLE MANAGEMENT E-LEARNING(3)",
    "describe_ch": "課程深入探討社會事業與永續經營管理，透過數位線上學習，結合案例分析、跨領域專案，幫助學生掌握核心知識與技能。學生將學習設計與規劃創新事業，培養具社會責任感、領導力及全球視野的專業人才，落實永續發展。",
    "describe_eh": "The course delves into social enterprises and sustainable management, utilizing digital online learning combined with case analysis and interdisciplinary projects to help students master core knowledge and skills. Students will learn how to design and plan innovative businesses, developing professional talent with a sense of social responsibility, leadership, and a global perspective, while implementing sustainable development.",
